=='''General'''==
Eternity Challenges (EC) are the third {{Keyword|eternity|Eternity}} tab, unlocked by reaching [[Eternity#Eternity_Milestones|Eternity Milestone]] 6 (have 8 Σ). There are 10 Eternity challenges, each with their own unique penalty (similar to [[Infinity#Infinity_Challenges|Infinity Challenges]]), with the goal being to reach the specified target [[Revolution#Score|Score]] under those penalties.

* Unlike Infinity Challenges, where there is the time to complete, each EC initially has 5 difficulties to complete, and every difficulty of an EC will increase the penalties and/or raise the target Score. 
* After completing Insane Trial 4, a 6th difficulty will be available to complete. Each EC difficulty is considered to be an individual challenge by the game, meaning there are a total of 60 ECs.

Completing an EC will award the player 1 free AP, and an extra magnet chance multiplier for each clear beyond 50. Each EC (after the first) is unlocked by completing difficulty 2 of the previous EC.
