==='''Eternity Challenges Milestones'''===
{{Keyword|eternity|Eternity Challenges}} have their own milestones based on the number of EC completed.
#3 EC completions: Keep your [[Infinity#Infinity_Challenges|{{Keyword|inf|Infinity Challenges}}]] on {{Keyword|eternity|Eternity}} ''(including fastest completion times)''
#5 EC completions: [[Revolution#Prestige|Prestiging]] now resets nothing
#8 EC completions: Unlocks [[Eternity#Supernova|Supernova]]
#10 EC completions: Keep fastest [[Infinity|{{Keyword|inf|Infinity}}]] time on {{Keyword|eternity|Eternity}} ''(needed for [[Eternity#Animals_Milestones|Animals Milestone]] 5 to work correctly)''
#30 EC completions: Every 4 Supernovae gives 1 free level to all [[Eternity#Laboratory|{{Keyword|rp|RP}}]] upgrades
#32 EC completions: Every 4 Supernovae gives another free level to all [[Eternity#Laboratory|{{Keyword|rp|RP}}]] upgrades
#35 EC completions: Every 2 Supernovae gives another free level on all [[Eternity#Laboratory|{{Keyword|rp|RP}}]] upgrades
#50 EC completions: Unlocks [[Eternity#Dilation_&_Dilation_Tree|{{Keyword|dtp|Dilation Tree}}]]
